    "description": "Iran’s seasonal celebrations connect the arrival of spring, autumn harvests and winter gatherings with food, storytelling and shared ritual. Nowruz, Chaharshanbe Suri, Yalda, Sadeh and Mehregan have distinct histories and forms that vary between communities. [s1][s2][s3][s4][s5]",
